config EMUL_LUMO
	bool "Emulator for the Lumo ambient light sensor"
	default y
	depends on I2C_EMUL
	depends on DT_HAS_QACADEMY_LUMO_ENABLED
	help
	  Plays the part of a Lumo chip for every "qacademy,lumo" node on an
	  emulated I2C bus. DT_HAS_QACADEMY_LUMO_ENABLED only exists once a
	  binding for "qacademy,lumo" does, so the emulator is only built
	  together with your binding.

config EMUL_LUMO_DAYLIGHT
	bool "Simulate a sunrise around every emulated Lumo part"
	depends on EMUL_LUMO
	help
	  Starts a thread that sets the light level of every emulated part
	  half a second before each whole second of uptime, for the first
	  seven seconds. Exercise Set 4's application is run with it.
